WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.308
A failed team notification does not mean the visitor lost their submission.

00:00:06.358 --> 00:00:08.339
The enquiry is still here.

00:00:08.389 --> 00:00:13.885
The site retries failed notifications automatically, up to three times.

00:00:13.935 --> 00:00:16.776
You can also use Resend notification.

00:00:16.826 --> 00:00:20.759
In this recording, we leave that control untouched.
